{"ID":"20240118151305-xzradge","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151305-xzradge","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151305-xzradge\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151305-wrpv0nj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122100904-wiaoe6a\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122100904-wiaoe6a\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:298,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:298\u0026#125;","title":"084云实","type":"doc","updated":"20240129165111"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151305-wrpv0nj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151305-wrpv0nj","updated":"20240122100419"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味辛温，主泄利，肠澼，杀虫蛊毒，去邪恶结气，止痛除热，主见鬼精物，多食令人狂走，久服轻身通神明。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122100848-46ai21p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122100848-46ai21p"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】处处有之。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122100850-430kgs2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122100850-430kgs2"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味辛微苦，性温。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122100852-niqix14","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122100852-niqix14"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】云实为止泻，截疟，杀虫要药。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122100855-3j7czog","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122100855-3j7czog"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【苏颂】治疟多用。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122100857-seg3rj9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122100857-seg3rj9"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一钱至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122100859-gq8aon5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122100859-gq8aon5"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】寒利者禁忌。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122100842-s5b6ejz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122100842-s5b6ejz"}},{"ID":"20240122100859-b5o8gth","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122100859-b5o8gth"}},{"ID":"20240122100859-5mey5jk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122100859-5mey5jk","updated":"20240129164826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第84味药，云实。中药里面呢，我们有几种，这个药专门治疗疟疾的。一个是常山苗，我们称为蜀漆，常山。一个是云实，这种都是治疟，疟疾，往来寒热下利这种。这种天行时疫，就是瘟疫，长江黄河以前沿岸一带，过去二次大战的时候在大陆上开战的时候，他们用奎宁来治，实际上真正，他们后来看到中医用常山，用这个云实，他们去拿去化验的时候发现它治疟的效果，里面它的药效比那个奎宁大100倍，所以中医还是厉害的。那这个常山我们后面会介绍。"}]},{"ID":"20240122100904-wiaoe6a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122100904-wiaoe6a","updated":"20240129165111"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个云实呢，肠病就是下利，下利不止，杀虫杀毒，就是肠瘟疫嘛，杀里面的瘟疫，下利不止，那这个味辛有一点苦味，性温，那是止利、下利不止非常好用的药，杀虫，肚子里面有虫哦，都可以用。那一般来说你只要看到病人是疟疾，往来寒热，下利不止，呕涨吐下泻，吃什么都吐，然后拉肚子，拉的人都虚掉了，很多人腹泻，这个会死掉很多人，像秘鲁，国家死的，很多人死在腹泻上面，就这个拉肚子，拉拉肚子死掉真的很难听，实际可以不死的，但他们不会治嘛，实际上像我们的常山、云实，我们有很多的药，真的中药到后来，我们用药治疟，不管他是不是疟，我们都按照症来辨的，如果没有好我们利小便，这个都可以把利止掉，这是云实。所以大家只要以后看到这个药，看到这个疟疾呀，肚子里面长虫哦，寄生虫，都可以用。"}]}]}